">不</span><span begin="3:50.619" end="3:50.919">如</span><span begin="3:50.919" end="3:53.218">纵情燃</span><span begin="3:53.218" end="3:54.190">烧吧</span></p><p begin="3:54.360" end="3:57.380" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:54.360" end="3:54.839">有</span><span begin="3:54.839" end="3:56.759">一天会再发</span><span begin="3:56.759" end="3:57.380">芽</span></p></div><div begin="4:00.559" end="4:09.497" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="4:00.559" end="4:09.497" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:00.559" end="4:01.009">不</span><span begin="4:01.009" end="4:01.709">妥协</span><span begin="4:01.709" end="4:02.199">直</span><span begin="4:02.199" end="4:02.900">到变</span><span begin="4:02.900" end="4:09.497">老</span></p></div></body></tt>